; Compiler-diagnostics harness (gh#168). Reads its `.camdl` fixtures from
; `test/lints/` and the model corpora (`ocaml/golden`, `tests/*`) by
; resolving the real repo root at runtime — the corpora outside the
; `ocaml/` dune root cannot be pulled in as `(deps ...)`. `(source_tree
; lints)` makes the in-tree fixtures available; the runtime resolver reads
; the originals.
(test
 (name test_diagnostics)
 (modules test_diagnostics)
 (libraries compiler ir alcotest)
 (deps (source_tree lints) (source_tree ../golden)))
